  <Properties>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[Are you interested in improving cost/performance by moving from Intel to ARM? Not sure what to expect? I will share my experience moving EC2 servers, ECS Docker containers, and a CI/CD pipeline (including CodeBuild and CodePipeline) from Intel to ARM.

This meeting is related to our March meeting (Apple Silicon M1: Developing on an ARM processor ). If you missed it, look for the recording on our YouTube channel. https://www.youtube.com/c/sgfaws]]></Value>
    </description>
